{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle! Capture! Die!</strong> Automon Arena is a fast-paced monster-catching autobattler, now with online multiplayer! Invite your friends for a free-for-all Automon brawl (or play against bots if your friends keep beating you)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Wishlist now</strong> to get notified when the game releases!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Watch\u00a0</strong>animals try to kill each other!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Observe hilarious auto-battles and cheer your team on (it helps them deal more damage, it really does)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810160/extras/b6dda6d8353d0f11b81122f975cccd55.poster.avif?t=1774433343\" width=518 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810160/extras/b6dda6d8353d0f11b81122f975cccd55.webm?t=1774433343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810160/extras/b6dda6d8353d0f11b81122f975cccd55.mp4?t=1774433343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Capture&quot; Automons </strong>to build your dream team!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With over 51 Automons split among 10 elemental types, there are bajillions (yeah, I calculated it) ways to build your bunch of brawly beasts! Gather a variety for coverage of go all-in into one type for that sweet 4-of-a-kind bonus!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810160/extras/3825b45b5cc1bf313f3d6ea9a504de48.poster.avif?t=1774433343\" width=398 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810160/extras/3825b45b5cc1bf313f3d6ea9a504de48.webm?t=1774433343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810160/extras/3825b45b5cc1bf313f3d6ea9a504de48.mp4?t=1774433343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Travel</strong> across the land, searching far and wide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a map shared with other players to find more animals to beat up, events that improve your team, NPCs, bosses and other players who dared to come near you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810160/extras/ec590277dc9dfc0419133be9cc5019f4.poster.avif?t=1774433343\" width=220 height=140 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810160/extras/ec590277dc9dfc0419133be9cc5019f4.webm?t=1774433343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810160/extras/ec590277dc9dfc0419133be9cc5019f4.mp4?t=1774433343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the very best</strong>\u00a0Automon trainer in the world<strong> (</strong>by eliminating all competition)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beating other players will not only show them that your Automons are so much cooler than theirs, it will also brings them closer to defeat! Be the last one standing to win the match!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810160/extras/b23236ff5c77577a2a648c3acd5968be.poster.avif?t=1774433343\" width=518 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810160/extras/b23236ff5c77577a2a648c3acd5968be.webm?t=1774433343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810160/extras/b23236ff5c77577a2a648c3acd5968be.mp4?t=1774433343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn\u00a0</strong>from your designated Automon professor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laugh or cringe at the stupidest humour you've seen in a video game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810160/extras/df1f048a7741d5ece57f232818f51d11.poster.avif?t=1774433343\" width=384 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810160/extras/df1f048a7741d5ece57f232818f51d11.webm?t=1774433343\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810160/extras/df1f048a7741d5ece57f232818f51d11.mp4?t=1774433343\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810160?t=1774433343","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3810160?t=1774433343","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810160/46c294f8a1e289ae049c0fe9ea95691100171bec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774433343","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3810160/46c294f8a1e289ae049c0fe9ea95691100171bec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774433343","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3879790,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class